VERSION: 5.0.0
PREFIX: GSSC-HLR-

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PUBLIC-FRONTEND-HLRS
TITLE: GSSC Public Frontend

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-HLR-1
TITLE: Public Frontend Application
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website SHALL have a public-accessible frontend application.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-OBJ-1

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PUBLIC-FEATURE-HLRS
TITLE: Public Frontend Features

[REQUIREMENT]
