UID: GSSC-HLR-5
TITLE: Public Calendar
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend SHALL have a public calendar.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-OBJ-11

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-HLR-6
TITLE: Public Research Tools Page
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend SHALL have a public research tools page.
<<<
